+// biased exponent 1..2*bias-2, FRSQRTE of positive normals). If any lane is something else (zero, denormal,
+// infinity, NaN, a negative FRSQRTE input, an FRECPE whose result would be denormal), nothing has been written
+// yet and FpEstimateSlowPath computes the whole instruction with FPCR and FPSR. It runs as a plain call: the
